        <li>Seven kingdoms, seven sacred animals: designing a world around animal-bonded power</li>
        <li>Publishing a 564-page full-colour illustrated edition independently</li>
        <li>From music and fashion to fiction: one storyteller's long road to a debut novel</li>
      </ul>

